(text "2/4  LM5176 4-switch buck-boost charger  (VIN_P 22-26 V -> NODE 0-26.2 V, ~100 W)" (at 15 15 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 470918ef-ae7e-4836-b953-55550a944bbc))
(text "NODE = chassis output and capacitor bank (via CM01).  fsw ~248 kHz (RT 33k), Vout 26.2 V (634k/20k), UVLO ~19 V, CCM, hiccup off (MODE 200k: confirm in datasheet)." (at 15 20.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid bd92ad7f-89e8-4763-bc87-8e533bb1ddf3))
(text "Power FETs: 60 V class (input TVS clamps up to ~48 V).  Gate nets HG1/LG1/HG2/LG2 and SW1/SW2 are local labels; keep gate loops short in layout." (at 15 23.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid f52454c3-d89e-4642-980c-9bc5ef74f1ee))
